<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="ow-t ow-d" class="fig-light" style="background:#fff">
    <title id="ow-t">Why a drive across town can be longer than a walk</title>
    <desc id="ow-d">A small street grid with a park in the middle. The walker crosses the park on a footpath. The driver has to follow one-way streets around the block, so the car route is longer.</desc>
    <rect width="760" height="330" fill="#fff" />
    <g fill="#eef3f6">
      <rect x="60" y="40" width="160" height="90" rx="6" /><rect x="260" y="40" width="240" height="90" rx="6" /><rect x="540" y="40" width="160" height="90" rx="6" />
      <rect x="60" y="170" width="160" height="120" rx="6" /><rect x="540" y="170" width="160" height="120" rx="6" />
    </g>
    <rect x="260" y="170" width="240" height="120" rx="10" fill="#dcefe0" />
    <text x="380" y="282" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Archivo Variable, Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="650" fill="#4d7a58">Park</text>
    <g stroke="#9aa6b2" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="2 9" stroke-linecap="round">
      <path d="M40 150 H720" /><path d="M240 20 V310" /><path d="M520 20 V310" />
    </g>
    <g fill="#9aa6b2">
      <path d="M150 150 l-10 -6 v12 z" /><path d="M390 150 l-10 -6 v12 z" /><path d="M630 150 l-10 -6 v12 z" />
      <path d="M240 90 l-6 10 h12 z" /><path d="M520 230 l-6 -10 h12 z" />
    </g>
    <path d="M230 300 C 300 250 420 210 512 160" fill="none" stroke="#c4157a" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1 10" />
    <path d="M230 300 H240 V150 V30 H520 V160" fill="none" stroke="#161b3d" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <g font-family="Archivo Variable, Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-weight="700">
      <circle cx="230" cy="300" r="13" fill="#fff" stroke="#c4157a" stroke-width="4" /><text x="230" y="305" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#161b3d">A</text>
      <circle cx="520" cy="160" r="13" fill="#fff" stroke="#c4157a" stroke-width="4" /><text x="520" y="165" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#161b3d">B</text>
      <text x="300" y="232" font-size="14" fill="#c4157a" transform="rotate(-24 300 232)">Walking path through the park</text>
      <text x="300" y="20" font-size="14" fill="#161b3d">Car: one-way streets around the block</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Footpaths, parks and plazas are open to walkers but not to cars, and one-way streets send drivers around the block. Over a mile or two that can make the drive the longer route.</figcaption>
</figure>
